Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Kenari">Kenari</a>&nbsp;(---.TYLR.splitrock.net)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;02-17-01 00:54<br>
<br><HTML>I thought that this was so much fun.I really can't explain why. We were there as friends; killing each other. It was fun to see and talk to everyone without having to worry about  being killed by a mob. {It was okay to be killed by friends} Plus we joined together to attack a few non members. The only thing wrong was that I don't think we recruited any new members, and I wish we had....prolly should have advertised more to the public or something. Anyway it was exactly as described--a free for all brawl, and I truly can't remember when I have had a better time on EQ. There were 3 of us here at home and the laughter was non-stop!          Kenari</HTML></font></tt><p>
