Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Quickening">Quickening</a>&nbsp;(---.olsusa.com)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;02-17-01 11:03<br>
<br><HTML>Well...I was bing a bit of a B last night. I didnt have much fun, but that was because of outside personal issues going on, which Eld and Jigs know about. BUT...after I settled myself down, and worked out the tears from just getting overly frustrated at everything, it was a blast. I particularly liked taking Til down from full health to a bit above a quarter bar of health using only Selo's and Bellow. I told you Til, you can't hit what you can't catch. :)<br>
<br>
Also...of particular importance to me last night was the power leveling I recieved. For those who don't know, I had to restart my account last night. My room mate and I shared an account, and we both got sick of fighting over the computer to see who's going to play. And, since it was his account originally, I got the new one. Hopefully soon I'll be back at level 22, and be able to go on the really really cool raids. :) Big thanks to Eld, Kenth, Bin, Jigs, Daph, and whoever else I missed that was there. :) That really really meant a lot to me, and I love you guys for it. :)<br>
<br>
~ Q</HTML></font></tt><p>
