Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Jiggles">Jiggles</a>&nbsp;(---.roleplayers.org)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;02-17-01 11:26<br>
<br><HTML>The event for me last night was fun.  I particularly loved turning Bindail into my pet twice, and killing many people with him.  Heh..  Now, it doesn't say much for my physical combat, but damn ya if you think yer gonna pound me.. I'll make ya pound someone else.  HEH..  But the event did kind of lose that "recruiting" idea we had, and once the level 50+'s showed up it was more aggrovating than fun because we couldn't walk out the door.<br>
<br>
I'm sorry for anyone who lost XP by being killed by the guards.  I laughed SO hard I couldn't breathe when the guard killed me.. and then I freaked when I looked over at Eldaron's screen and saw two or three other people getting killed.  ACK!<br>
<br>
As for Quick, we will make sure you get a speed recovery.  Maybe you can soon head off to Oasis and take down some nice little gators... heh.  gator stew.<br>
<br>
-Jiggs</HTML></font></tt><p>
